  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The happy man would have happy faces round him; a sad face is a reproach to him for his happiness.",
      "output_sha256": "96eeb8a28cff7a5440509011b25be538456dd345032a81dde2d60bfd9ba82e56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "96eeb8a28cff7a5440509011b25be538456dd345032a81dde2d60bfd9ba82e56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "So, as I board the 2:10 train on Saturday, I generously share my good fortune.",
      "output_sha256": "6190459257121635954af79267a53fe7ac304df9628bb997091f5d67203095a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.486417,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "34c730302f5cef5e17ba8a3ce39333e150f9b005789ddd033f1d4f8485cb5373"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6190459257121635954af79267a53fe7ac304df9628bb997091f5d67203095a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The cabman, feeling that an effort is required of him, mentions that I am the first gentleman he has met that day; he penetrates my mufti and calls me captain, leaving it open whether he regards me as a Salvation Army captain or the captain of a barge.",
      "output_sha256": "b8bb0919a757120c65ced071f76521e310b0b168b5079fa0f3a9b03988fbd127",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8bb0919a757120c65ced071f76521e310b0b168b5079fa0f3a9b03988fbd127",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The porters rush to my cab, jostling slightly over who will have the privilege of attending to me.",
      "output_sha256": "2aa42a6e954b446b03ba34b4809188dedf893482efb1e506f96573b8da392cf4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.416667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "171123e916624b20cfa90d35f9ccfecce8b0e0caf7e9757897a10d85e9a37034"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2aa42a6e954b446b03ba34b4809188dedf893482efb1e506f96573b8da392cf4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Inside the station things go on as happily.",
      "output_sha256": "fabbd7d2226a8720ae3b7453129f9580495720f8c63a605b42ef0eb4a8ff9eec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "fabbd7d2226a8720ae3b7453129f9580495720f8c63a605b42ef0eb4a8ff9eec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The booking-office clerk gives me a pleasant smile; he seems to approve of the station I am taking.",
      "output_sha256": "4dbb76fa3ace51b85bae06adead426feb6d54b494a9705c20b575481ff53a012",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "4dbb76fa3ace51b85bae06adead426feb6d54b494a9705c20b575481ff53a012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He implies that while others may opt for Brighton, a gentleman like me would find this choice more fitting.",
      "output_sha256": "d0c29c6b139cabdc70d61dc9602a7e755d606b2e024d95363aa9c259127de003",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.478332,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1e8535508d806163ce5be165b60df5dc1accfbd8f5695448b00cf097250e0a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d0c29c6b139cabdc70d61dc9602a7e755d606b2e024d95363aa9c259127de003",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He takes a moment to highlight that my ticket allows for a return on Tuesday, which, between us, I hope to utilize.",
      "output_sha256": "6b385c3721ee043e5cd4017817cfa4c16d1dc628d96e8bcd41d4140a2260dbac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.478332,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1e8535508d806163ce5be165b60df5dc1accfbd8f5695448b00cf097250e0a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b385c3721ee043e5cd4017817cfa4c16d1dc628d96e8bcd41d4140a2260dbac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In exchange for his courtesies I push him my paper through the pigeon hole.",
      "output_sha256": "d0c6c2d4fcb930da2727c0f9ab54b1dc2d4088d71f3c6c60c234601c265a161a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0c6c2d4fcb930da2727c0f9ab54b1dc2d4088d71f3c6c60c234601c265a161a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A scruffy little boy thrusts it into my cab; I didn’t ask for it, but today, in the spirit of happiness, I give him a penny.",
      "output_sha256": "73d50ddb0c8334bdfa8eb3793eaef58dbef4d67cf0995d01ae585eff6423f85f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.483566,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "733291c2b1bf71200c066bd953ed8e607eba89a41f1f0eb86521d4173ca675a7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "73d50ddb0c8334bdfa8eb3793eaef58dbef4d67cf0995d01ae585eff6423f85f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I follow my porter to the platform.",
      "output_sha256": "992e0602b68c024f52eeae269708b1a08656f36dd69d06f917f163e55570354e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "992e0602b68c024f52eeae269708b1a08656f36dd69d06f917f163e55570354e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"On the left,\" says the ticket collector.",
      "output_sha256": "5f01ddc1841865a1cf33c3fdbc388ea36908f62bcb31e74cd9f8b0a00aec9b3a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f01ddc1841865a1cf33c3fdbc388ea36908f62bcb31e74cd9f8b0a00aec9b3a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He has said it mechanically to a hundred persons, but he becomes human and kindly as he says it to me.",
      "output_sha256": "6812773ba84d9108c3afba1e49fb169e6ed00fff417adda2188c50d1827973b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "6812773ba84d9108c3afba1e49fb169e6ed00fff417adda2188c50d1827973b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I feel that he really wishes me to get into the right train, to have a pleasant journey down, to be welcomed heartily by my friends when I arrive.",
      "output_sha256": "964f0619a2331a10ecc14b361d5970806fd5a5f3df3daf71c73cdfeb6efbda35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "964f0619a2331a10ecc14b361d5970806fd5a5f3df3daf71c73cdfeb6efbda35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It feels less like a transaction among a crowd and more like an interaction between individuals.",
      "output_sha256": "07ffcf3eb035f38c6e48fab65dbfa828e8a6d837afa089271375e8287fab43fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.334375,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bb620eb31f716a4848df3cb6980f86f3cba539cced14b9cccff89453d27b5fd1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07ffcf3eb035f38c6e48fab65dbfa828e8a6d837afa089271375e8287fab43fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The porter has found me an empty carriage.",
      "output_sha256": "8ac1828041989ff05db64851000829c01d4053d6580804cd248219a93936e838",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ac1828041989ff05db64851000829c01d4053d6580804cd248219a93936e838",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He informs me about the train's departure, the stops we’ll make, and the anticipated arrival time.",
      "output_sha256": "27e9245a0125c728d82f82ae2d968e3f957f6e843ffb2174750cf307f4640e4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.246104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5f4c99811842aede80f32a917a3fc1f7e4bd11ac148ad40167b4aff875bdd53"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "27e9245a0125c728d82f82ae2d968e3f957f6e843ffb2174750cf307f4640e4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Am I sure I wouldn't like my bag in the van?",
      "output_sha256": "0a41227bf41ba15dc03aa8b39fad58c5c5df99c66b7ac24576dbe09c906e3f46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a41227bf41ba15dc03aa8b39fad58c5c5df99c66b7ac24576dbe09c906e3f46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Can he get me any papers?",
      "output_sha256": "ffdfaadde402daba639b803564dee6632edc2f51cacde8c03fc9725fc670e89d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "ffdfaadde402daba639b803564dee6632edc2f51cacde8c03fc9725fc670e89d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I decline; I don’t wish to occupy my mind with reading.",
      "output_sha256": "76fb21796f4bb36963ca415e4cdb54691cf47303e7cb3002d1ad88a08871c36f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.240191,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d07e31853e7fb1b8f2029301a13a66858df26cfb11eb723d3541a828549fb36",
        "8dc465a57ccd3901965f903a91d25bf01f40d2cba95c5c1d6b4c2006f1ddc08c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "76fb21796f4bb36963ca415e4cdb54691cf47303e7cb3002d1ad88a08871c36f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I give him sixpence, and there is another one of us happy.",
      "output_sha256": "e3b4e389420e1f86c56b747089ecc4df14367b4ec84534341dc1ee934a7dd3ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e3b4e389420e1f86c56b747089ecc4df14367b4ec84534341dc1ee934a7dd3ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Presently the guard.",
      "output_sha256": "165a86124203f8c4d91429001bb5dd2161d786bb5961d8e13218f9844c3ec68d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "165a86124203f8c4d91429001bb5dd2161d786bb5961d8e13218f9844c3ec68d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He also seems pleased that I have selected this one particular station from among so many.",
      "output_sha256": "4d182e71fcde5f5ef0099e2356b7115aabac3f961e699b3d9028bf93773417b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d182e71fcde5f5ef0099e2356b7115aabac3f961e699b3d9028bf93773417b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "His satisfaction is not surprising; he expected me to select this route.",
      "output_sha256": "ac60d6a7d03e536a6df2abdd68f5a5b1419a065c34f657b50e6722b5e6c32c1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.364286,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2ef85250a37a1f1bcac87b12c1fb8619879e8236d4c6ad2d7e57b0600fe87117"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac60d6a7d03e536a6df2abdd68f5a5b1419a065c34f657b50e6722b5e6c32c1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is a very good run down in his train, and he shouldn't be surprised if we had a fine week- end. …",
      "output_sha256": "cc5ec18238f336badd35fdae88caa6c5f0f7b57ac5f6df5a71e279477dab600f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "cc5ec18238f336badd35fdae88caa6c5f0f7b57ac5f6df5a71e279477dab600f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I stand at the door of ray carriage feeling very happy.",
      "output_sha256": "a3e0eaaa2862f1b5b6365bfdc05f0825f679b1455e52727eb8b8baf1a61529db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3e0eaaa2862f1b5b6365bfdc05f0825f679b1455e52727eb8b8baf1a61529db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is good to get out of London.",
      "output_sha256": "0b59a6c2b9ea4c0c3086189c499e3433c86570dd2a5b726d97a9940582e8f529",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "0b59a6c2b9ea4c0c3086189c499e3433c86570dd2a5b726d97a9940582e8f529",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Come to think of it, we are all getting out of London, and none of us is going to do any work to- morrow.",
      "output_sha256": "bbaad328c09db7d4b49fc99aa593dd7cc4666b84a7a15ea9955a3b37731d2942",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbaad328c09db7d4b49fc99aa593dd7cc4666b84a7a15ea9955a3b37731d2942",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How jolly!",
      "output_sha256": "1146a6a396a3252257d635746d88c859e4a59c9c2e16c3954d4ce0ae0782b47a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "1146a6a396a3252257d635746d88c859e4a59c9c2e16c3954d4ce0ae0782b47a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet I can’t help but think of my porter again.",
      "output_sha256": "612fc71bf21113664e3b65cfaf677b153229ef4f200fcbd3fdc06013ccf008dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.328824,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30,
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0ba82955646f27ac8b1b175fb5faa5feeaf97a8e21912f0d1859ad53a509c6f0",
        "ab3e8aa07407df4586a44fd29dc286bfc6f43d55adfbba15be2229ffe1cb4d57"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "612fc71bf21113664e3b65cfaf677b153229ef4f200fcbd3fdc06013ccf008dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I wish I had offered him more than sixpence.",
      "output_sha256": "28b1083a262b35857dc0019a5319e27d31d047109156cf1bfda4768bd7230169",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.666667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "48f3b86bc99561f91d1e7ea856cb12a7544878e9fc9b3c79e35f66468c832823"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "28b1083a262b35857dc0019a5319e27d31d047109156cf1bfda4768bd7230169",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Still, he may have a sweetheart and be happy that way.",
      "output_sha256": "9ddd562d75fcc1b7c2a6ef5896798806afda8c23d6d5ab1487c41ccdc43c35d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ddd562d75fcc1b7c2a6ef5896798806afda8c23d6d5ab1487c41ccdc43c35d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are off.",
      "output_sha256": "0bb734ac8fa3fa3537fa57ea8b892c986d5347a6ad28331aded20e4de3cb9374",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "0bb734ac8fa3fa3537fa57ea8b892c986d5347a6ad28331aded20e4de3cb9374",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have nothing to read, but then I want to think.",
      "output_sha256": "20dbf3eb9ed8ef63e08599feaa1155fb33ee633743e3bf3c0a9e864056f5f059",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "20dbf3eb9ed8ef63e08599feaa1155fb33ee633743e3bf3c0a9e864056f5f059",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is the ideal place in which to think, a railway carriage; the ideal place in which to be happy.",
      "output_sha256": "71e721e4be6bdea27576c7770e888bf917365a02464f971a00793320ea552cbb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "71e721e4be6bdea27576c7770e888bf917365a02464f971a00793320ea552cbb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I ponder whether I’ll perform well at cricket and tennis, croquet, billiards, and all the other delightful games I plan to enjoy.",
      "output_sha256": "995cca8fbcbdb2e32de6738825fd0dc6157656eddb222940382b3a1ad45e5d4e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.515087,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7b8cad0eeda8613193822fe0bafbe5941c17da1a8214e1f0fbd7d7685b4a4ef"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "995cca8fbcbdb2e32de6738825fd0dc6157656eddb222940382b3a1ad45e5d4e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My gaze drifts outside, landing on children attempting to play cricket in a grimy backyard.",
      "output_sha256": "e2e544fbccc190dadb513d10446bb52b23d3ef4128ab217ea0061e04d36a11bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.445714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c31ff6c0b989f9082fc36868cf5dceaa0fafd8c3fd885877f4a378ef9f3b25e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e2e544fbccc190dadb513d10446bb52b23d3ef4128ab217ea0061e04d36a11bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Poor little beggars!",
      "output_sha256": "a4af042d301138babd07aedbdaf49c1eead9d2af04706a1a27aaf3af517236db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4af042d301138babd07aedbdaf49c1eead9d2af04706a1a27aaf3af517236db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Fancy living in one of those horrible squalid houses.",
      "output_sha256": "0191e2f2e684b0eb896f0a85c03562f3d6bcc77e53f63dee2b79b0cec35f6ed7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "0191e2f2e684b0eb896f0a85c03562f3d6bcc77e53f63dee2b79b0cec35f6ed7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But you cannot spoil to- day for me, little backyards.",
      "output_sha256": "fa8db3ea689a1392d50c3ca651c90984f1c915e5825003f088c17feb25c17496",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa8db3ea689a1392d50c3ca651c90984f1c915e5825003f088c17feb25c17496",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On Tuesday perhaps, when I am coming again to the ugly town, your misery will make me miserable; I shall ask myself hopelessly what it all means; but just now I am too happy for pity.",
      "output_sha256": "b37fa4b0f54d348a36f866025817f3f436000c16cd1843dc32fdd15b839d26b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "b37fa4b0f54d348a36f866025817f3f436000c16cd1843dc32fdd15b839d26b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I remind myself that they might not envy me; they could very well be happy too.",
      "output_sha256": "9e79073407940595c7cf29e04698121d6b5518e6a47877466ed1baeff35825ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.26022,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43,
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f36aabe5e56f72d94ad3673669e94961567d1d7c70cdc248ffd95a393b4c1c33",
        "c79ffcbcbb8fa4af47358440e7243f2f833d5408c7363d8fc835015491097bce"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e79073407940595c7cf29e04698121d6b5518e6a47877466ed1baeff35825ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of course; we are all happy to-day.",
      "output_sha256": "5a35912897027bfecfc032c9ceaa30878db149cee9f14fe722db321e25b4bfc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a35912897027bfecfc032c9ceaa30878db149cee9f14fe722db321e25b4bfc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "See, I am waving back to you.",
      "output_sha256": "f6a7901d1eedd364cff017c46c2d97bbea7eabe111c2d27e17b0fb763c231ee8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6a7901d1eedd364cff017c46c2d97bbea7eabe111c2d27e17b0fb763c231ee8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As my eyes scan the carriage, they settle on my bag.",
      "output_sha256": "02eb563c615bce51d5ce67d3fe188616e0a572131ddee783df8218f181427f4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.598864,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e89b4e2fc4d56da808bb60c7c40a273b2ebee850f28668b96a2df48a97271bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "02eb563c615bce51d5ce67d3fe188616e0a572131ddee783df8218f181427f4a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Have I put everything in?",
      "output_sha256": "8a5552208603f27a8b36f1fcc6b837693c7f7add29b2af91c8119fc191df8939",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a5552208603f27a8b36f1fcc6b837693c7f7add29b2af91c8119fc191df8939",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of course I have.",
      "output_sha256": "d4faefa94cdf1bbbda01ac887ee7cf82600b9487502add14ac292e38b94d191d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4faefa94cdf1bbbda01ac887ee7cf82600b9487502add14ac292e38b94d191d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Still, an unsettling feeling creeps in, suggesting I’ve forgotten something crucial.",
      "output_sha256": "f67447a8e43a0b94ffbff518e62712b0cff9038d0c34b4e5f4f885717ed45692",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.281731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "70b55f57123195752ac0841726725a9cd1e30f6f26fb03c60f49fd8f9a99c88d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f67447a8e43a0b94ffbff518e62712b0cff9038d0c34b4e5f4f885717ed45692",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Well, I can soon settle the question.",
      "output_sha256": "c04a91f5676741bf34e8e776e8609b8055ba4d862081602c4b61d468308f34d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "c04a91f5676741bf34e8e776e8609b8055ba4d862081602c4b61d468308f34d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let's start with to-night.",
      "output_sha256": "56f0109fa066f08da8fac7169c8606777ae18ab4355891528e0653d53b5f6d02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "56f0109fa066f08da8fac7169c8606777ae18ab4355891528e0653d53b5f6d02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Evening attire—yes, that’s packed.",
      "output_sha256": "d0f573a858b69ac527e4a1fca74e0ffa9d58f4e5ad607976e331c6e0938943ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.335985,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6068e88b6170e68dad581a7e0962ccb7e3c0f1d00896e9abafa02bc5d5a7e346"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d0f573a858b69ac527e4a1fca74e0ffa9d58f4e5ad607976e331c6e0938943ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Shirts, collars …",
      "output_sha256": "bc8dbac16f0c449da5129d6a65416b01d8f5feadb6cdec484ed1ea8bc81671d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc8dbac16f0c449da5129d6a65416b01d8f5feadb6cdec484ed1ea8bc81671d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I go through the whole programme for the week-end, allotting myself in my mind suitable clothes for each occasion.",
      "output_sha256": "df8a61c6a6ff6b95b1d37b4c4613c887068c716d6d0263646da9f8a1141f11e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "df8a61c6a6ff6b95b1d37b4c4613c887068c716d6d0263646da9f8a1141f11e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yes, it appears I have accounted for everything I might need.",
      "output_sha256": "bd648d07af114f4f1f49c479de5bf84350477811b15a31cbf5a5c09fb390185a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.483531,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba9c74f42cb6ab97ac9b16b138130fa11339ad8476efa53a451f34bf098a57ba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bd648d07af114f4f1f49c479de5bf84350477811b15a31cbf5a5c09fb390185a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But what a very jolly programme I am drawing up for myself!",
      "output_sha256": "d2edd270003059403512b25f35875235f5abbcd5d957b3956a41cb408f7be5d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2edd270003059403512b25f35875235f5abbcd5d957b3956a41cb408f7be5d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Will it really be as delightful as that?",
      "output_sha256": "f3ce6252410b1e047c2178bc8f5d7f6d820513662b3b912db0c05a7676c190ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3ce6252410b1e047c2178bc8f5d7f6d820513662b3b912db0c05a7676c190ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Well, it was last time, and the time before; that is why I am so happy.",
      "output_sha256": "85fdaa781f7b4a7b184508ebd8fd22a10684acd11114bdb6d7a327ebd4eee20b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "85fdaa781f7b4a7b184508ebd8fd22a10684acd11114bdb6d7a327ebd4eee20b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The train draws up at its only halt in the glow of a September mid-afternoon.",
      "output_sha256": "22e41d3d5b210edf7e859cdb2af060e64a9d084e04be8f08716c33e63e5b6573",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "22e41d3d5b210edf7e859cdb2af060e64a9d084e04be8f08716c33e63e5b6573",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is a little pleasant bustle; nice people get out and nice people meet them; everybody seems very cheery and contented.",
      "output_sha256": "f2c15edf1924dc928dacb43cde220f2c46f3144afdb6f18361e9c382f7a3e8a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2c15edf1924dc928dacb43cde220f2c46f3144afdb6f18361e9c382f7a3e8a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Then we’re off again, and I know my stop is next.",
      "output_sha256": "c306f80211024bedc3d22f66a29fbc1f88f42bad70423c10a8d2e9df2beddc02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.548986,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "63f4862902325a5c4605aed0a67ebea9930068403446d3a322be5cd2c48c2917"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c306f80211024bedc3d22f66a29fbc1f88f42bad70423c10a8d2e9df2beddc02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are there.",
      "output_sha256": "d9984738a5df8e5aa16c3df63f62dd77c091d37da86ecd3c2bac4725f2923be2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "d9984738a5df8e5aa16c3df63f62dd77c091d37da86ecd3c2bac4725f2923be2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A porter greets me with a friendly smile and a casual “Nice day.”",
      "output_sha256": "77a282ed07e71e144de070cc80355a61a2deef5407bc1bbebf51f4c152f7ae26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.681538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6350ea1ae39a2c958bd5f1a5ebab5f6fc46908bdf5e7fa9ea24ab34ab3381a6b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "77a282ed07e71e144de070cc80355a61a2deef5407bc1bbebf51f4c152f7ae26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I see Brant outside with the wagonette, not the trap; then I am not the only guest coming by this train.",
      "output_sha256": "c0e67dea0d2bbd1a3b774fb4c5c4483a201eb34649c8ec1dbf5b57a9dcd7a94a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "c0e67dea0d2bbd1a3b774fb4c5c4483a201eb34649c8ec1dbf5b57a9dcd7a94a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Who are the others, I wonder.",
      "output_sha256": "91ff002e4c1d74de3e7c714549b6701335baa024284522d87d46f269038d6005",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "91ff002e4c1d74de3e7c714549b6701335baa024284522d87d46f269038d6005",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Is there anyone I know?",
      "output_sha256": "3988a4d4ed39078b4bcf096f6a9808d6f50c9eb0fe004cd67ed557b93892962c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.506677,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e8e0caaa0b8aff263395be823c573563f173309af7d04683e9da8c378a932cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3988a4d4ed39078b4bcf096f6a9808d6f50c9eb0fe004cd67ed557b93892962c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57,
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "To my delight, I see Bob and Mrs. Bob, and—oh!—Cynthia!",
      "output_sha256": "7a5d4dc95c0d9c46f28338d65d6ffc73af06cf0c168972a8e783aba69da94726",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.506677,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e8e0caaa0b8aff263395be823c573563f173309af7d04683e9da8c378a932cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
